{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I believe exposure of StringNames is relatively safe, but the naming of the function deviates from the general rules of Godot's CPP codes.\r\n\r\nThe function to be bound should be public, not private. In this case, the prefix underscore should not be added. Then, there are two functions to be named get_node_list, so it is fine to rename the function you want to expose (bind) to a name that shows it exists for GDScript, such as `get_node_list_as_typed_array()` IMO.","created_at":"2025-04-22T18:37:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T18:37:33Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105552#discussion_r2054663315","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105552","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054663315"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105552#discussion_r2054663315"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105552"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054663315/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":1807,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":33,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054701857","pull_request_review_id":2785079786,"id":2054701857,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc56eEMh","diff_hunk":"@@ -1796,6 +1804,7 @@ void AnimationNodeStateMachine::_bind_methods() {\n \tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"rename_node\", \"name\", \"new_name\"), &AnimationNodeStateMachine::rename_node);\n \tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"has_node\", \"name\"), &AnimationNodeStateMachine::has_node);\n \tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"get_node_name\", \"node\"), &AnimationNodeStateMachine::get_node_name);\n+\tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"get_node_list\"), &AnimationNodeStateMachine::_get_node_list);","path":"scene/animation/animation_node_state_machine.cpp","commit_id":"d193af78c5adbe8ed444396ba62706848fb9fcf5","original_commit_id":"a969e8625215162f5e235347dbc2a58b60d78e5f","user":{"login":"adamwych","id":6526954,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjY5NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6526954?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych","html_url":"https://github.com/adamwych","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I believe I saw this naming pattern used for some other method and took inspiration from there, but I don't remember what it was.\r\n\r\nAs I understand there doesn't seem to be any standardized suffix for cases like this, so I'll change it to `get_node_list_as_typed_array` as you suggested.","created_at":"2025-04-22T19:04:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T19:04:25Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105552#discussion_r2054701857","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105552","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054701857"},"html":{"href":"htt